Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, tabidatsu fune wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, a ship is taking off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(612,218,618,232,9,4305)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:33.40,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx175\fscy143\pos(662,872)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\\pos(1402,642)}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ucyuu no kanata Iskandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's about to take off to Iscandar carrying the fate of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We'll return for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Smile back at the people waving their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:02.85,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:02.85,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.93,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Is that the enemy's main fortress ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:46.22,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Garmillas...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:50.24,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{Our mother planet of Garmillas \Nwas destroyed by them.}That's the enemy who destroyed\Nour mother planet of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:55.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I want to entrust the future of Garmillas to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:02:00.17,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{You know how meaningless war is.\NPlease guide the people with your heart.}You, bearing a heart that recognizes\Nthe meaninglessness of war…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.77,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Please, use it to guide our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:09.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Calling on the Dezariam army’s commander.{Calling on the commander of Dezariam army.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:12.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{kikan}You mercilessly destroyed the planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:18.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{ooku}You've taken a number of lives, and now, you're attempting to take Iscandar away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:22.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{kono}We can't overlook this tyranny no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.35,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{daihyosha}I demand a meeting between representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{sento}Combat is not our intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}In order to avoid further loss on both sides...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:47.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Ranhalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,No matter how meaningless it may seem, \Nthere are certain things I can't forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.62,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Not even the Desler Cannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:30.06,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,How foolish of you to play around\Nwith wave motion energy…{How foolish of you to play \Nwith wave motion energy...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:37.82,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,You don't understand anything,\Nas you only live in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:52.28,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What's happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:55.55,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Rising gravitational inclinations\N detected at random locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:59.60,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,At random ? \NThat huge fortress isn't the center ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:01.40,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,Multiple locations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:05.66,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,...a countless number of them within\N a 300,000 km radius of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.00,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Steady !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:29.17,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Gravitational waves are colliding. \NEach ship escape at its own discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.82,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,I'm falling !\NHold my hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:38.40,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Their radial gravity can move planets freely. \NOnce we're caught, we're done for !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:42.28,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,Abominable planet Iscandar...{ is a cursed planet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:48.20,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{Its cursed power must be \Ncontrolled by Dezariam.}That accursed power of yours must be \Nplaced in the care of {\i1}Us{\i0} – Dezariam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.53,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,You're unworthy of such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:59.24,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,You play around with it mindlessly, which will lead to the total destruction of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:07.66,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{Don't get involved any further and just leave.}This no longer concerns you…so leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.06,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,There's nothing you people can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:17.46,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,Let Dezariam "tune" everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}To the Yamato crew...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Führer Desler...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:33.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Looks like I underestimated \Nour enemy's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:38.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We'd better withdraw, \Nso we can get back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,What's with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.40,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,He shot without warning...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:49.06,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That's his way of apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:12.37,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,Earth and Garmillas have shared a growing number of technologies{equipment} since the security agreement was signed 5 years ago, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:18.08,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,Yamato has taken quite a lot of damage, \Nso the situation is dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:22.26,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,How could Captain Kodai be so reckless ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:23.95,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,You were watching him, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.06,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We're all in this together !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:34.80,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}That's what all of us decided that day ! \NSo why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.17,def2,VOICE,0,0,0,,Hey, Domon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:42.46,def2,HIRATA,0,0,0,,Everyone's hungry. \NMake the rounds quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:43.97,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.62,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Mr. Hirata...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:51.20,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,“We're all in this together”...\NWhat’s that all about ?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:07:01.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Iscandar is being towed by the enemy fortress,\N and it's accelerating toward the star called Bolzon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:07.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If they destroy it in place of the lost planet,\N they can transport Iscandar by warping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:11.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{sorega}I believe that's our enemy's objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:15.71,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,If we let them get away again, there's no\N guarantee we'll be able to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:21.91,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,We should avoid further combat and\N prioritize the rescue of everyone on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:28.57,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Slow down.\N I do understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:33.33,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,So, what's your rescue plan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:43.95,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,As Iscandar approaches the star, the atmospheric temperature is rapidly rising, causing the frozen part of the ocean to melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:50.97,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kono}If the situation continues, it'll create a chance to rescue the migrant fleet, which is stranded in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.33,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Combined with your Garmillan \Ntechnology, we can pull this off for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:58.68,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:03.46,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Then, what's left is the rescue\N of the Iscandar royalty, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:08.86,def2,MELDA,0,0,0,,Queen Starsha's resolve \Nto remain on the planet is firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:16.97,def2,MELDA,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai, can I ask you\N to persuade Queen Starsha ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:26.22,def2,MELDA,0,0,0,,Your brother, Kodai Mamoru, had a\N tremendous impact on Queen Starsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:28.31,def2,MELDA,0,0,0,,If you ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:33.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I broke the promise with the\N very person who saved him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...and used the wave motion\N gun right before her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:39.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{Starsha}I don't think Queen Starsha will listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.55,def2,MELDA,0,0,0,,But even Queen Starsha understood...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:45.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,She had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:53.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I forced her to bend Iscandar's principles\N and made her betray her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:58.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I believe Führer Desler is the\N right person to persuade...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:06.02,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Kodai, why did you come all the way here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.02,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,To save us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Or to run away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I understand the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:24.11,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I appreciate the kindness of the \NEarth from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:29.77,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{gamilus}I request your continued support\N in order to save the people of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:37.00,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{Looks like Ranhalt entrusted\N the future to a small man...}It's become apparent that\N the future Ranhalt bequeathed…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:39.84,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...was entrusted to a small-minded man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:56.53,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,The survivor list isn't complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.17,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Don't feel so down, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.40,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,Lieutenant...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.20,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,We're the key to this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:08.04,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,You'll take Bofen's place since he's wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:09.51,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.80,def2,GOL,0,0,0,, It's a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.31,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,I'll command the second ship well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:23.97,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,Yabu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:26.95,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,...I have no words of comfort...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.37,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,...but never lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:33.71,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,Right. I'll return to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:09.31,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Mœlders, I've been informed\N that you've lost Daeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.75,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.46,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I sense fluctuations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.97,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Fluctuations deep in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:18.24,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,I'll make amends at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.28,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}No need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:26.84,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Such fluctuations are proof that Dezariam's\N thousand-year dream is not some mere fantasy.{a mere dream.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:29.77,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{seigyo}Try to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:34.84,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Don't push those detestable ones away,\Nrather, take them in or win them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.80,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}That will make us more complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:43.91,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We, the light side, are paired\Nwith Iscandar, the dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:44.71,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,, {\c&HFFFE9F&}Make haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.75,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Looks like they're waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.71,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{douhou}Not just his own citizens...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:57.28,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{douhou}...Desler will surely seek to save us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.80,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{sorega}That's the nature of Garmillas...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.88,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{sonoyou}...because we "cultivated{farmed}" them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:14.20,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,But have some water at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:17.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's the point of living through this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Garmillas is already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.86,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,We have the planet Galman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.62,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,That place...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.62,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:30.20,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,You don't understand how we feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.95,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,Why not ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:34.06,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm a Zaltz ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:36.35,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm not a native Garmillan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:43.11,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,Garmillas invaded and brought\Nruin to your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.53,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,Our turn has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:51.17,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,It's painful to see your dedication.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:53.73,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,It's like we're forced to pay our dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:56.93,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,What's that got to do with it ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:01.06,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,I have two fathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.75,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,...one Garmillan, the other Zaltz !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:03.82,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,Two fathers !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.66,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,{umare}It doesn't matter where I was born !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:09.06,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,, I’ve received love, lots of love !\N
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.93,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,{sore}I want to repay the favor \Nno matter how small it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:13.73,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.95,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:27.00,def2,BAREN,0,0,0,,...where you're born, \Nor where you grow up...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.86,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Mr. Baren !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:32.02,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,You used to be in the military, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:36.00,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We received an encrypted military message. \NDo you think you can decode it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:51.10,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(962,848)}Fellow citizens of Garmillas, the time has come to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:56.05,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(946,842)}This is a race against time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:14:01.60,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(960,848)}Implement the following instructions immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.50,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(960,850)}Assess the damage to each ship once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:10.50,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(974,850)}Abandon non-airtight ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:15.50,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(976,846)}Hide in the mist and act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.20,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(966,848)}Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:25.00,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(958,852)}Enemy eyes will not think to look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:10.28,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Unlike the big ones, we can sink\N these with a certain number of hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:14.37,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Why couldn’t they just transport me\Nstraight into the belly of these big ships ?{Why can't they just transport me\N into the interior of a big ship ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:17.46,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,The SMITE system's not\N that convenient, you know ?{Apparently, it's not that easy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.20,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:23.88,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.48,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,How pointless...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:47.55,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,Synchronize all ships. \NLet's start with five.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.05,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.84,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Launch decoys ! Don't screw up !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:31.24,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,It's time for the first group to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.73,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:33.68,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.53,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:35.46,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:35.93,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:45.08,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,It's a success, Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.85,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(964,852)}Fellow citizens, don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:54.00,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(960,850)}Don't accept fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:57.90,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(960,848)}In our new land on planet Galman...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:01.15,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(944,844)}...we'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:00.70,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,Hell yeah !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.71,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,All ships, maintain synchronization and begin to dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.00,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:20.62,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Where's this light coming from ? Report !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:34.24,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,All ships, abort diving and fan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:38.73,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Recon alert. \NTell the migrant ships to spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:39.97,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:56.24,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Engine output's flatlined !\NIt’s not responding !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:01.73,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,Damn. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.97,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.95,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,That should be the {\i1}last{\i0} noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:02.15,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,I was careless for not predicting their\N practical use of their dimensional dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:13.13,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,However, the method of detection and capture of a submerged ship shouldn't exist in this space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.80,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,This marks the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.11,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Powerful energy detected at the enemy fortress !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.44,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,It's changing course to aim at...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:28.15,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,...the migrant fleet on the sea !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What about Asuka's shield projectile ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.06,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,No time ! It's too far !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.86,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Captain, the wave motion gun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.82,def2,NISHINA,0,0,0,,No use !\NEven the Desler cannon didn't work !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.06,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.73,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,The wave motion shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:47.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Sit in the line of fire and deploy the \Nwave motion shield at maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:51.17,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,That should at least deflect the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.35,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,But will the Yamato hold ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:55.24,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Is there any other choice ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:00.97,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,We're all in this together, right ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:20.60,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Deploy the Geshtam wall and follow the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:11.57,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Wave motion shield output has dropped to 23% !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.82,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,It's powering up for a second shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.02,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Stop this !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.20,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:40.17,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}No more fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.60,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:50.77,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'll ask the commanders of the \NEarth and Garmillas forces to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:52.95,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Give me a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:55.86,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,If I don't ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:58.95,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}You won't get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:12.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}It's time to tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:16.84,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...the truth about the blue blood of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:20.55,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Truth...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:24.51,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Commanders of both forces, \Ncome to the Crystal Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.71,0:22:27.44,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(726,1052)\3c&H000000&}Immigrant Fleet Rescue Operation. Go Beyond the Dimensional Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000000&}Episode 6
