Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:58.48,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo}Behind the sorrow...\N{\i1}kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:04.58,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru}...happiness is always waiting for you{next}\N{\i1}tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:17.50,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou}Let's turn that fairy tale into truth\N{\i1}sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:29.16,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku}You whisper with a spark in your eye\N{\i1}anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:46.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai}You don’t dream to get hurt\N{\i1}yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.98,0:23:55.54,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ai wa ima mo hikari}Love still shines even now\N{\i1}ai wa ima mo hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.55,0:24:02.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tada hitotsu no inori}There’s only one prayer\N{\i1}tada hitotsu no inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:11.77,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{mirai wa mou hajimatte iru}The future has already begun\N{\i1}mirai wa mou hajimatte iru
