Comment: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.97,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Comment: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:03.66,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I see. Then, what's left is the rescue of the Iscandar royalty, but...

